  "description": "Holt – our first mountain bike. Unashamedly XC. All of our knowledge distilled into an XC hardtail – with an emphasis on creating the perfect Ultra-distance race machine.\n\nRidden to a course record victory in the 2024 Highland Trail 550 by Alex McCormack. The bike is designed to be fast and efficient, with class leading compliance and comfort.\n\nSteel excels at making a short travel hard tail, by not over-building the frame we’ve been able to focus on maintaining the ‘quality of the material’, to deliver a ride feel that can only be steel.\n\nCompliance, traction, agility, zip, snap, grip, flow… A fast, off-road adventure machine.",
